=0A=0ABeyond the valuation gaps, it=E2=80=99s worth looking at how business=
es have fared =0Aafter going public. BCA Research=E2=80=99s Noah Weisberger=
 notes that while =0Apost-listing IPO market capitalization is about $2.7 t=
rillion, nearly twice =0Aprevious peaks in real terms, when scaled to total=
